"Graham is an Avowed Brute of middling rank who lost his fiancee in the Submerger floods."
"He wears one jade hoop earring; Alden took its match from his dead fiancee's ear in the flood."
"At the F-city Christmas market he punched at Bash-nor; Alden blocked it with a preserved balloon."
"Drusi-otta levitated him away; he faces Artonan and Anesidoran sentences."
